  "gear": "La Sportiva Prodigio Zest/Moonlight",
  "description": "Abbreviated presidential traverse with some exposed wet scrambling for fun. Really needed this - I’m not myself when I’m away from the mountains. Super wet and muddy and not very runnable, spoiled by my Colorado trails. Washington -> Monroe -> Franklin -> Eisenhower -> Pierce -> Jackson. Listening to the 538 Kamala VP draft picks while on a bunch on mountains in the Whites renamed after ded white presidents. Super windy and foggy on most of the peaks but cleared up a little bit at the end for some views",
